    "No Continue listening snapshot is saved yet. This is not live playback and not the queue. Play an episode in AntennaPod to write the App Group snapshot. Until then there is no episode title or remaining time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Continue listening snapshot is saved yet. This is not live playback and not the queue. Play an episode in AntennaPod to write the App Group snapshot. Until then there is no episode title or remaining time."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch kein Weiterspielen-Snapshot gespeichert. Das ist keine Live-Wiedergabe und nicht die Warteschlange. Spiele eine Episode in AntennaPod, damit die App den App-Group-Snapshot schreibt. Bis dahin gibt es keinen Episodentitel und keine Restzeit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens AntennaPod and sends play. Plays the loaded episode, or after a cold launch the previous run’s unplayed episode shown paused in the mini player. Does not invent any other continue episode.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens AntennaPod and sends play. Plays the loaded episode, or after a cold launch the previous run’s unplayed episode shown paused in the mini player. Does not invent any other continue episode."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet AntennaPod und sendet Wiedergabe. Spielt die geladene Episode oder nach einem Kaltstart die ungehörte Episode des vorherigen Laufs, die im Miniplayer pausiert angezeigt wird. Erfindet keine andere Weiterspielen-Episode."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
